# The public half of the PLANETAI release signing key, in ssh-keygen's allowed_signers format.
#
# Public on purpose: this is the line every node checks an update against, and it is copied verbatim
# into the heredocs in `install`, `update.sh` and `bin/planetai` — those three run before or without a
# tarball, so they cannot read this file. `tests/test_release_consistency.sh` fails if the four drift.
#
# The private half is the Foundation's. It is generated once, on Tomas's machine, lives in the
# Foundation's password manager with one copy on the ship machine, and never enters this repository,
# the tarball or a log. docs/HANDOFF_signing.md has the command that makes it and the rotation.
#
# ISSUED 19 September 2026, fingerprint SHA256:1+MvZWJUBWisjY08E1KR77znXLs2lVWgVkh+Z++8IL4.
# Rotation, and what to do if the private half is ever exposed, are in docs/HANDOFF_signing.md.
